@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@username = phase1_user
@phone = 13900000001
@password = Test123456
@token = 替换为登录返回的data.token

### 1. 注册
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "phone": "{{phone}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}


### 2. 登录
### 执行后复制 data.token 到 @token。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "{{phone}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}


### 3. 携带 Bearer token 访问当前用户
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 4. 非 Bearer 格式访问，应该失败
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Token {{token}}


### 5. 退出登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 6. logout 后再次访问当前用户，应该失败
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 7. 登录失败次数限制示例
### 连续执行 5 次后，该手机号会被临时锁定 10 分钟。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "{{phone}}",
  "password": "Wrong123456"
}


### 8. 锁定期间即使密码正确，也应该失败
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "{{phone}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}
